  "goodToKnow": "Die Wiederwahl is re-election: sich zur Wiederwahl stellen, die Wiederwahl verpassen. The German Federal President can be re-elected only once (two five-year terms), while the chancellor has no term limit; Kohl and Merkel each served 16 years. Wiederwählen means to re-elect, while wiederholen means to repeat. Plural: die Wiederwahlen."
